This repository has a full instruction file at `/AGENTS.md` in the repo root.
Read it before making changes — it covers the package-tier architecture
(enforced by ESLint import boundaries), the contracts-first backend/frontend
flow, non-negotiable conventions (cursor pagination only, soft deletes on
catalogue data, no raw Redis keys), and known environment gotchas specific to
this Windows dev setup (stale dev-server processes on port reuse, `bun
--watch` not covering sibling workspace packages).

Do not restart, kill, or start the API/web dev servers without asking first —
the user runs these themselves. Verify a fix against the already-running
stack (curl, direct DB query) instead.

`packages/shared/README.md` and other per-package READMEs take precedence
over `AGENTS.md` for anything specific to that package.
